      "unitNotes": [
        "Mass is not force; ounces and pounds are avoirdupois mass. US pint/quart/gallon are liquid, explicitly labeled.",
        "psi/1000ft is a pressure-gradient-derived equivalent density at standard gravity9.80665m/s2: rho=gradientPaPerM/g0. Label this convention; do not describe it as an SI density unit.",
        "Slug=1lbf*s2/ft=0.45359237*9.80665/0.3048kg.",
        "Density and volume selections must be independent of any shared unit toggles. Reject finite-input combinations whose output overflows."
