          "Mohm"
        ],
        "outputPowerUnit": [
          "W",
          "kW",
          "MW",
          "hp-mechanical",
          "BtuIT/h"
        ]
      },
      "formulas": {
        "vi": "R=V/I;P=V*I",
        "vr": "I=V/R;P=V*I",
        "ir": "V=I*R;P=V*I",
        "vp": "I=P/V;R=V*V/P",
        "ip": "V=P/I;R=P/(I*I)",
        "rp": "I=sqrt(P/R);V=sqrt(P*R)"
      },
      "contract": [
        "Use strictly positive knowns for a unique passive-resistor solution. Zero pairs can be underdetermined; reject with explanatory error instead of0/0.",
        "Normalizea/b independently from selected pair and unit before solving. Change pair must reset incompatible units; hidden old prefix must not leak.",
        "Power hp means mechanical550ft*lbf/s, not metric or electric hp; BTU means International Table BTU perhour. Show exact conventions.",
        "V=IR and P=VI assume ideal resistive/DC quantities; this does not compute impedance or reactive power."
      ],
      "sources": [
        "nist",
        "prefixes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "grade-letters",
      "slugs": [
        "grade-calculator"
      ],
      "proposedAlgorithms": [
        "grade-letters",
        "grade-letter-final"
      ],
      "proposedModes": [
        "letter-assessments",
        "letter-final"
      ],
      "fields": {
        "assessments": "JSONrows{name,grade,weight};grade letter or explicit numericpercentage",
        "weightBasis": [
          "percentage",
          "relative-points"
        ],
        "letterScale": "editable JSONrows{letter,percentage}, example only",
        "current": "numericpercentageorletter forfinalmode",
        "target": "numericpercentageorletter forfinalmode",
        "remainingWeight": "percentage0<weight<=100"
      },
      "exampleScale": {
        "A+": 98,
        "A": 95,
        "A-": 91,
        "B+": 88,
        "B": 85,
        "B-": 81,
        "C+": 78,
        "C": 75,
        "C-": 71,
        "D+": 68,
        "D": 65,
        "D-": 61,
        "F": 0
      },
      "formulas": [
        "Map every letter to the entered representative percentage. Numeric grade strings parse as finite numbers, not strings passed toNumber without validation.",
        "Current average=sum(mappedGrade*weight)/sum(weight). Percentageweights total<=100; relativepointweights may exceed100.",
        "If remainingWeight=r and completed average=c, required=(target-c*(1-r/100))/(r/100). If deriving r from percentrows, r=100-sum(completedweights).",
        "Do not infer unique percentages fromGPA values or aletterrange. ExampleA95 is a user-editable scoring assumption, not a universal gradingstandard.",
        "A requiredscore>100 is a valid unattainable-without-extra-credit result, not inputerror. Negative requiredscore can be reported as minimum0while retainingraw mathematicallyrequiredvalue."
      ],
      "validation": [
        "Trim/case-normalize letters; uppercase A- andB+ without erasing sign. Reject unknownsymbols, duplicate scaleletters, malformedJSON, blanknumericcells, nonprimitivevalues.",
        "Weights positive; totalnonzero. Reject duplicate normalizedscaleletters. Permitnumericgradesabove100only with anexplicit extra-credit policy switch if desired.",
        "Do not output a finalletterunless a separate declaredthresholdtable exists. Representative inputvalue does not define gradecutoff."
      ],
      "integrationRisks": [
        "Reuse GPA row/schema pattern, not semantic GPA output; max-grade-points constraint wouldrejectpercentages."
      ],
      "sources": []
    },
